  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations in PNG has been actively engaged in Women, Peace, and Security (WPS) and peacebuilding initiatives for more than a decade, with programming primarily centred on facilitating thesustained implementation of the Bougainville Peace Agreement in the Autonomous Region of Bougainville and promoting peacebuilding and conflict mitigation efforts in Hela and the Southern Highlands provinces,with a strong focus on women and youth empowerment.This project intends to empower women and girl</narrative>
  </description>
